{
  "kind": "lesson",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "switches-break",
  "packId": "lawp.circuits.basics",
  "courseId": "workshop",
  "moduleId": "control",
  "title": "A switch breaks the loop",
  "skillIds": [
    "circuits.switch"
  ],
  "estimatedMinutes": 8,
  "taskRev": 1,
  "description": "A switch is a gap you can open and close. It is not a dimmer. Closed lights. Open is dark.",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "explain",
      "md": "## On purpose, not a little bit\n\nA switch is a planned gap. Closed, the path is a loop and the lamp can light. Open, the path is broken and the lamp is dark. An ordinary switch is not a dimmer. It does not sit halfway and leak a cozy glow. It is a door: shut or open.\n\nThis bites when you “turn it a little” and expect half brightness. That is a different part (a variable resistor). The live world here only toggles closed and open.\n\n![Open switch and closed switch](assets/switch-states.svg)\n\n```text\nOPEN    gap    I = 0    dark\nCLOSED  path   I = 1    lit\n```\n\nA common mistake is treating the switch as a brightness knob. Toggle it closed, then Check."
    },
    {
      "type": "activity",
      "id": "close-switch",
      "kind": "experiment",
      "engine": "world-v1",
      "promptMd": "Close the switch so the lamp lights.",
      "skillIds": [
        "circuits.switch"
      ],
      "constraintMode": "final",
      "predict": {
        "promptMd": "If you leave the switch open, the lamp…",
        "kind": "mcq",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "dark",
            "md": "Stays dark — the loop is broken"
          },
          {
            "id": "dim",
            "md": "Glows dim, because a switch is a dimmer",
            "misconceptionId": "switch-is-a-dimmer"
          },
          {
            "id": "lit",
            "md": "Still lights a little through the gap",
            "misconceptionId": "open-loop-still-lit"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "dark"
      },
      "world": {
        "parts": [
          {
            "id": "battery",
            "type": "battery",
            "props": {
              "cells": 1
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "switch",
            "type": "switch",
            "props": {
              "closed": false,
              "label": "Switch"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "lamp",
            "type": "lamp",
            "props": {
              "brightness": 0,
              "label": "Lamp"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "meter",
            "type": "meter",
            "props": {
              "current": 0
            }
          }
        ],
        "connections": [
          {
            "from": "battery",
            "to": "switch"
          },
          {
            "from": "switch",
            "to": "lamp"
          },
          {
            "from": "lamp",
            "to": "battery"
          }
        ],
        "actions": [
          {
            "id": "toggle-switch",
            "label": "Toggle the switch",
            "target": "switch",
            "op": "toggle",
            "key": "closed"
          }
        ],
        "rules": [
          {
            "id": "closed-on",
            "when": [
              {
                "path": "switch.closed",
                "op": "eq",
                "value": true
              }
            ],
            "set": [
              {
                "target": "lamp",
                "key": "brightness",
                "value": 2
              },
              {
                "target": "meter",
                "key": "current",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "open-off",
            "when": [
              {
                "path": "switch.closed",
                "op": "eq",
                "value": false
              }
            ],
            "set": [
              {
                "target": "lamp",
                "key": "brightness",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "target": "meter",
                "key": "current",
                "value": 0
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "view": {
          "kind": "graph",
          "assetMap": {
            "lamp@brightness=0": "assets/lamp-dim.svg",
            "lamp@brightness=1": "assets/lamp-dim.svg",
            "lamp@brightness=2": "assets/lamp-bright.svg",
            "battery": "assets/battery.svg",
            "resistor": "assets/resistor.svg",
            "meter": "assets/meter.svg",
            "voltmeter": "assets/voltmeter.svg",
            "switch@closed=false": "assets/switch-open.svg",
            "switch@closed=true": "assets/switch-closed.svg",
            "fuse": "assets/fuse.svg"
          }
        }
      },
      "goal": {
        "all": [
          {
            "path": "lamp.brightness",
            "op": "eq",
            "value": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      "explainAfter": {
        "promptMd": "Closed completed the loop. Open would break it again. That is all an ordinary switch does."
      },
      "hintLadder": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "kind": "concept",
          "md": "The switch starts open."
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "kind": "concept",
          "md": "Open is a gap. Closed is a path."
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "kind": "concept",
          "md": "Toggle once. The lamp should jump from 0 to 2."
        },
        {
          "level": 4,
          "kind": "assist",
          "md": "Toggle the switch to closed, then Check."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "check",
      "id": "dimmer-tf",
      "kind": "tf",
      "promptMd": "An ordinary switch can sit halfway and make the lamp half as bright.",
      "answer": "false",
      "explainMd": "A switch is open or closed. Half brightness is a different part.",
      "skillIds": [
        "circuits.switch"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
